  "instructions": [
    "Place beef brisket in a large Dutch oven or heavy pot over medium-high heat.",
    "Sear beef on all sides until browned, about 5 minutes total.",
    "Add garlic, chipotle peppers, oregano, cumin, coriander, and salt. Cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add Makrut lime leaves, water, and chipotle peppers in tomato sauce. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring mixture to a boil, then cover and transfer to the oven to braise for 2 1/2 hours at 300°F.",
    "Using two forks, shred the beef into bite-sized pieces.",
    "Strain the braising liquid through a fine-mesh sieve into a large bowl, discarding the solids.",
    "Add the shredded beef to the bowl with the braising liquid and stir to combine.",
    "Serve the barbacoa hot, garnished with cilantro and served with warm tortillas, lime wedges, and your choice of toppings.",
    "Chop cilantro for garnish, if desired."
  ],
